  "States are per capability and per dimension; they are not summed or weighted.",
  "source_present_coverage_unassessed means code exists; it is not test or equivalence evidence.",
  "original_backend means the IDE still uses Studio Pro logic for that capability.",
  "Command catalog access in MXRB Tasks does not establish product parity."
 ],
